WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.977
Theo: Skyler, keep your eye on the ball.

2
00:00:16.978 --> 00:00:22.789
Riley: That's right. Don't worry about Chatter.

3
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:28.081
Chatter: Don't hurry. Don't worry!

4
00:00:28.082 --> 00:00:32.768
Sarah: Go, Skyler! Go, Red Team.

5
00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:34.906
Chatter: Go, Red Team!

6
00:00:34.907 --> 00:00:38.963
Skyler: Hey! Chatter is cheering for our team!

7
00:00:38.964 --> 00:00:50.024
Theo: Skyler, get the ball!

8
00:00:50.025 --> 00:00:52.655
Kelli: Yay, Skyler!

9
00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:54.878
Riley: Good job, Skyler!

10
00:00:54.879 --> 00:01:00.327
Skyler: I scored my first goal!

11
00:01:00.328 --> 00:01:03.644
Chatter: Go, Red Team! Go, Blue!

12
00:01:03.645 --> 00:01:05.415
Ben: Did you hear that?

13
00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:09.617
Now Chatter is cheering for both teams!

14
00:01:09.618 --> 00:01:18.634
Sarah: Oh no! The Blue Team scored another goal!

15
00:01:18.635 --> 00:01:20.467
Theo: The game is over.

16
00:01:20.468 --> 00:01:22.804
The Blue Team won.

17
00:01:22.805 --> 00:01:25.150
Riley: I had fun anyway.

18
00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.768
Theo: Me too.

19
00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:29.565
Chatter: Hooray for Red!

20
00:01:29.566 --> 00:01:33.492
Hooray for Blue!

21
00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.991
Chatter: Red, blue, red, blue!

22
00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:38.665
Skyler: Chatter, you're so funny!

23
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:42.170
I can't be mad because you make me laugh!

24
00:01:42.171 --> 00:01:45.185
Coach Ryan: You have a great parrot there!

25
00:01:45.186 --> 00:01:48.982
Skyler: A great parrot? But—

26
00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:51.344
Coach Tim: You should be proud of him.

27
00:01:51.345 --> 00:01:53.784
He's a very good sport.

28
00:01:53.785 --> 00:01:56.067
Skyler: Really?

29
00:01:56.068 --> 00:01:59.668
Coach Ryan: Yes. He cheered for both teams.

30
00:01:59.669 --> 00:02:02.516
Coach Tim: He knows that sports are fun.

31
00:02:02.517 --> 00:02:11.349
Skyler: That's right. Sports are fun, no matter who wins!

32
00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:14.795
Coach Tim: I think Chatter deserves a prize.

33
00:02:14.796 --> 00:02:23.105
Coach Ryan: For being the best sport!

34
00:02:23.106 --> 00:02:25.155
Skyler: Look, Chatter!

35
00:02:25.156 --> 00:02:29.332
Riley: A key chain with a red and blue ball on it!

36
00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:32.194
Chatter: Go, Red! Go, Blue!

37
00:02:32.195 --> 00:02:35.826
Kids: Ha-ha!
